PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D2

   1 a 0000 E48D2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] the SAME operand on the INPUT side -- [C288]
   4 a 0006      measured option/operand orthogonality on AUTOMATIC cells
   5 a 0006      (E46F1 output vs E46F3 input); this asks whether a STATIC cell
   6 a 0006      is class-invariant on the input side too. */
   7 c 0006   dcl inf file,
   8 c 0006       nm char(14) varying static initial('AB'),
   9 c 0006       k fixed bin(15);
  10 c 0006   open file(inf) stream input title(nm);
  11 c 0021   get file(inf) list(k);
  12 c 003C   close file(inf);
  13 c 0042   stop;
  14 a 0045 end E48D2;

CODE SIZE = 0045
DATA AREA = 0011
FREE SYMS = 38C3
END  COMPILATION
